WEBVTT

00:11:58.958 --> 00:12:02.351
The idea that an incumbent president

00:12:02.375 --> 00:12:05.393
should concede honorably and graciously

00:12:05.417 --> 00:12:07.976
and ensure a peaceful transfer of power,

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.298
rather than trying to use
every trick in the book

00:12:10.322 --> 00:12:11.559
to hang on to power,

00:12:11.583 --> 00:12:13.018
that's an American value too.

00:12:13.042 --> 00:12:14.601
If you stick with those values,

00:12:14.625 --> 00:12:16.768
you're going to be heard
by a lot more people

00:12:16.792 --> 00:12:18.559
and help bring the country together.

00:12:18.583 --> 00:12:20.768
And lastly, sorry folks,
voting is not enough,

00:12:20.792 --> 00:12:23.101
You're going to have to get
active, get involved.

00:12:23.125 --> 00:12:25.643
You could join and support
with your money.

00:12:25.667 --> 00:12:28.434
Some existing organizations,
powerful groups,

00:12:28.458 --> 00:12:30.726
like the Leadership Conference
on Civil Rights,